        "title": "Spark SQL + Delta Lake",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The \"Partition\" setting in a Data Flow Aggregate → \"Optimize\" tab is literally `spark.conf.set(\"spark.sql.shuffle.partitions\", N)`. The debug cluster button spins up an actual Spark cluster (typically a 4-8 node Databricks or HDInsight cluster). The \"publish and run\" action submits a Spark job to the Integration Runtime cluster."
    },
