      "text": "## 1. ARCHITECTURE"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-SPARKSQL.md#014",
      "path": [
        "08-SPARKSQL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:query-languages:08-sparksql, git-history:query-languages:08-sparksql]",
        "canonical_path": "query-languages/08-SPARKSQL.md",
        "concepts": "[sparksql]",
        "current_path": "query-languages/08-SPARKSQL.md",
        "id": "maxim:query-languages:sparksql",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "query-languages",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[sparksql]",
        "section": "query-languages",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Spark SQL + Delta Lake",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                        Apache Spark Architecture                             │\n│                                                                              │\n│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐    │\n│  │                   Spark SQL / DataFrame API                          │   │\n│  │   spark.sql(\"SELECT ...\")    df.filter(...).groupBy(...)             │   │\n│  │   Python (PySpark)  /  Scala  /  Java  /  R (SparkR)               │   │\n│  └──────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────┘   │\n│                                 │  identical execution plan                 │\n│  ┌──────────────────────────────▼───────────────────────────────────────┐   │\n│  │                   Catalyst Query Optimizer                           │   │\n│  │   Parse → Analyze → Optimize → Physical Plan → Codegen               │   │\n│  │   Rule-based + cost-based optimizations (column pruning, pushdown)   │   │\n│  └──────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────┘   │\n│                                 │                                           │\n│  ┌──────────────────────────────▼───────────────────────────────────────┐   │\n│  │             Distributed Execution (Driver + Executors)               │   │\n│  │   Stage 1 → shuffle → Stage 2 → shuffle → Stage 3                    │   │\n│  │   Each stage = DAG of tasks (1 task per partition)                   │   │\n│  └──────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────────┘   │\n│                                 │                                           │\n│  ┌──────────────────────────────▼───────────────────────────────────────┐   │\n│  │      Storage Layer                                                   │   │\n│  │      Delta Lake / Parquet / ORC / JSON / CSV / Avro                  │   │\n│  │      HDFS / S3 / ADLS Gen2 / GCS                                     │   │\n│  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘   │\n└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-SPARKSQL.md#015",
      "path": [
        "08-SPARKSQL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:query-languages:08-sparksql, git-history:query-languages:08-sparksql]",
        "canonical_path": "query-languages/08-SPARKSQL.md",
        "concepts": "[sparksql]",
        "current_path": "query-languages/08-SPARKSQL.md",
        "id": "maxim:query-languages:sparksql",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "query-languages",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[sparksql]",
        "section": "query-languages",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Spark SQL + Delta Lake",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "MapReduce bridge:\n  MapReduce: disk write between EVERY step (Map → disk → Reduce → disk)\n  Spark:     in-memory between steps; disk spill only when memory exhausted\n  Both:      distributed partitioning, shuffle concept, fault tolerance via lineage\n  Speedup:   10–100x for iterative jobs (ML, graph traversal); ~3–5x for single-pass ETL\n```"
    },
