        "section": "query-languages",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Spark SQL + Delta Lake",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```python\ndf.explain()               # physical plan only\ndf.explain(\"extended\")     # all 4 phases: parsed → analyzed → optimized → physical\ndf.explain(\"cost\")         # physical plan with row count and size estimates\ndf.explain(\"formatted\")    # tree format with node IDs, best readability (Spark 3.x)\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-SPARKSQL.md#023",
      "path": [
        "08-SPARKSQL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
