      },
      "text": "### Lazy Evaluation: Nothing Runs Until an Action"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-SPARKSQL.md#024",
      "path": [
        "08-SPARKSQL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:query-languages:08-sparksql, git-history:query-languages:08-sparksql]",
        "canonical_path": "query-languages/08-SPARKSQL.md",
        "concepts": "[sparksql]",
        "current_path": "query-languages/08-SPARKSQL.md",
        "id": "maxim:query-languages:sparksql",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "query-languages",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[sparksql]",
        "section": "query-languages",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Spark SQL + Delta Lake",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "T-SQL executes the moment you submit a query. ADF activities execute when triggered. Spark does neither: it builds a DAG of transformations and does not execute anything until you call an **action**."
    },
    {
      "id": "08-SPARKSQL.md#025",
      "path": [
        "08-SPARKSQL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:query-languages:08-sparksql, git-history:query-languages:08-sparksql]",
        "canonical_path": "query-languages/08-SPARKSQL.md",
        "concepts": "[sparksql]",
        "current_path": "query-languages/08-SPARKSQL.md",
        "id": "maxim:query-languages:sparksql",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "query-languages",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[sparksql]",
        "section": "query-languages",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Spark SQL + Delta Lake",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```python\n# None of these lines execute anything — they build a DAG:\ndf = spark.read.parquet(\"/data/orders/\")          # no read\ndf = df.filter(F.col(\"status\") == \"active\")       # no filter\ndf = df.groupBy(\"dept\").agg(F.avg(\"salary\"))      # no aggregation\ndf = df.orderBy(\"dept\")                           # no sort"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-SPARKSQL.md#026",
      "path": [
        "08-SPARKSQL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:query-languages:08-sparksql, git-history:query-languages:08-sparksql]",
        "canonical_path": "query-languages/08-SPARKSQL.md",
        "concepts": "[sparksql]",
        "current_path": "query-languages/08-SPARKSQL.md",
        "id": "maxim:query-languages:sparksql",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "query-languages",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[sparksql]",
        "section": "query-languages",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Spark SQL + Delta Lake",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "# THIS executes the entire DAG (read + filter + group + sort):\ndf.show()     # action: triggers execution, displays 20 rows"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-SPARKSQL.md#027",
      "path": [
        "08-SPARKSQL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:query-languages:08-sparksql, git-history:query-languages:08-sparksql]",
        "canonical_path": "query-languages/08-SPARKSQL.md",
        "concepts": "[sparksql]",
        "current_path": "query-languages/08-SPARKSQL.md",
        "id": "maxim:query-languages:sparksql",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "query-languages",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[sparksql]",
        "section": "query-languages",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Spark SQL + Delta Lake",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "# Other actions that trigger execution:\ndf.count()          # returns a count (full scan)\ndf.collect()        # returns all rows to driver as Python list — dangerous on large data\ndf.write.parquet()  # writes output to storage\ndf.first()          # returns first row\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "08-SPARKSQL.md#028",
      "path": [
        "08-SPARKSQL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:query-languages:08-sparksql, git-history:query-languages:08-sparksql]",
        "canonical_path": "query-languages/08-SPARKSQL.md",
        "concepts": "[sparksql]",
        "current_path": "query-languages/08-SPARKSQL.md",
        "id": "maxim:query-languages:sparksql",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "query-languages",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[sparksql]",
        "section": "query-languages",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Spark SQL + Delta Lake",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The consequence: `df.explain()` can be called before any data moves — it inspects the logical/physical plan without triggering execution. A common mistake is calling `df.count()` in a loop to validate each step — every call is a full job. Prefer `.show(5)` for spot-checks; defer execution to a single `.write()` call."
    },
